# D3-TR-003: An acid front advances through a carbonate-containing bed
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 20mL
add v1 CaCO3 0.0005mol
add v2 water 20mL
add v2 CaCO3 0.0005mol
add v3 water 20mL
add v3 CaCO3 0.0005mol
add v4 water 20mL
add v4 HCl 0.0002mol
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 3 courant 1
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v3 ph
inspect
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 15 courant 1
measure v5 ph
inspect
